{"availability":"available","full":"codeofaxel/Kiln","name":"Kiln","description":"Describe it or draw it — Kiln makes it real. The open-source MCP server for 3D printing: AI agents (Claude, Codex, Cursor, or any MCP client) design, generate, slice & print on Bambu Lab, Creality, Prusa, Elegoo, Klipper/Moonraker, OctoPrint, Duet/RepRapFirmware & any Marlin printer.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":91,"forks":17,"created":"2026-02-10T19:01:32Z","updated":"2026-10-05T20:43:11Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kiln3d.com/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=repo-about","topics":["3d-printing","ai","ai-agents","bambu-lab","claude","creality","elegoo","generative-ai","image-to-3d","klipper","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","moonraker","octoprint","openclaw","openscad","prusa","stl","text-to-3d"],"demo":"https://kiln3d.com/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme#demo","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:14.716Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:14.716Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:14.716Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:19.436Z","stars":89,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:00.397Z","stars":89,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-06T09:11:14.716Z","stars":91,"forks":17}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kiln lets AI agents (Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Codex, or any custom MCP client) drive real 3D printers end to end — Bambu Lab, Creality, Prusa, Elegoo, Voron, Sovol, AnkerMake, Artillery, FlashForge, QIDI, RatRig, and SparkX, over OctoPrint, Moonraker/Klipper, PrusaLink, and Direct USB.","In a single conversation, an agent can design a part, slice it, queue it on the right printer, monitor the camera, recover from failures, and ship the result. No human in the middle.","Reading this as an AI agent? kiln3d.com/agents is written for you rather than for the person running you: install, MCP config, the design-to-print loop, and exactly what Kiln will 